 visitor activity.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"usna-youngster-luau","subject_type":"tradition","entity_name":"Youngster Luau","title":"The Third-Class “Youngster Luau”","subtitle":"Class tradition within the alumni-link program","notes":"Use the Academy’s alumni-link overview to place this named class event in the midshipman calendar; participation is organized internally.","short_summary":"A named third-class gathering is part of USNA’s documented class-event cycle.","evidence_claim":"USNA lists the Youngster Luau among the events in its Another Link in the Chain program, which the article describes as honoring Naval Academy history and traditions.","source_url":"https://usna.edu/NewsCenter/2019/10/The_Might_of_the_Chain.php","source_title":"The Might of the Chain","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Internal midshipman event; no public participation is implied.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"usna-commitment-dinner","subject_type":"tradition","entity_name":"Commitment Dinner","title":"Mark the Seven-Year Commitment","subtitle":"Officer-professionalism program ceremony","notes":"Read the current Academy instruction for the ceremony’s purpose and keep it in its formal service-commitment context rather than treating it as a public dinner.","short_summary":"A dinner recognizes class members who have formally committed to the next seven years.","evidence_claim":"USNA’s current professionalism and civility instruction states that the Commitment Dinner celebrates class members who have formally dedicated the next seven years.","source_url":"https://www.usna.edu/Commandant/_files/documents/COMDTMIDNINST_1520.4D-PROFESSIONALISM_AND_CIVILITY_TRAINING_PROGRAM_NEW.pdf","source_title":"COMDTMIDNINST 1520.4D Professionalism and Civility Training Program","source_kind":"university_